title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; banner_militarization_cost = 2 if banner_militancy > 0.1 else banner_militarization_cost = 1; banner_militarization_cost = 3 if banner_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: year >= 1930 and far_right_force >= 30 and streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy and (chancellor != "Staal" or staal_time < 8)
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage on the streets between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>, nationalist <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>, communist <span style="color: #8B0000;">Rotfrontkämpferbund</span> (<span style="color: #8B0000;">**RFB**</span>), and our own the Banners. In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing civil war levels, as dozens of people are killed each month.

We must do something to protect the workers against these predations.

# - @battle: Test our defense units in battle against the fascists!
- @arm_rb: Increase training and armaments for the the Banners.
- @if_training: Train union members to fight as part of the <span style="color: #c00000;">Iron</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">Front</span>.
- @prussian_police_training: Use the Heartland police to help train the the Banners.
- @peace: Try to avoid all militant confrontations, as much as possible.
- @truce_rfb: Try to make peace with the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**RFB**</span>.
- @easy_discard

@battle
view-if: banner_militancy > 0.1 and banner_militancy < 0.5
on-arrival: banner_militancy += 0.1; loyalist_strength += 40; banner_strength -= 100; 
max-visits: 1

Many the Banners members are not ready for actual fighting, and thus quit. However, the remainder are toughened as a result. Our confrontations also provide ample recruiting material for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>.

@arm_rb
subtitle: -[+ banner_militarization_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= banner_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ banner_militarization_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= banner_militarization_cost; banner_militancy += 0.06; banner_strength += 50; loyalist_strength += 50; unionist_relation -= 3 if strife < 5; ddp_relation -= 3 if strife < 5; lvp_relation -= 3 if strife < 5

We have increased training and purchased more armaments for the the Banners.

[? if not concord_leave_banner and not banner_exit: [? if strife < 5: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] decries the militarization of the the Banners, and its members are leaving the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> organization. ?][? if strife >= 5: Seeing the strife that has filled the Commonwealth's streets, the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and [? if not lvp_formed:<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] seem to be convinced that it is necessary for the the Banners to be militarized, and mute their criticisms. ?] ?]

@if_training
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1
on-arrival: banner_militancy += 0.03; banner_strength += 200; loyalist_strength += 50; 
max-visits: 2

As part of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Iron**</span> <span style="color: #1A1A1A;">**Front**</span>, we are increasing coordination between the the Banners and the unions, and many union members want to become more involved.

@prussian_police_training
view-if: heartland_leader = "Bristol" or heartland_leader = "Pendrigon" and heartland_police_loyalty > 0.5
on-arrival: banner_militancy += 0.05; loyalist_strength += 50; heartland_police_training += 1

The loyal sections of the Heartland police can help train the the Banners.

@peace
on-arrival: banner_militancy -= 0.02; banner_strength -= 50; pacifism += 1

By not fighting, the strength of the the Banners atrophies. Pacifists in the party are gaining the upper hand.

@truce_rfb
subtitle: The <span style="color: #8B0000;">RFB</span> will be added to the balance of power.
choose-if: collectivist_relation >= 45
view-if: collectivist_truce == 0
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span> is not interested.
on-arrival: collectivist_truce = 1; collectivist_relation += 5; vanguard_strength += 50; banner_strength += 50; loyalist_strength += 50;

We have made at least a temporary truce with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, so that our respective paramilitaries will stop fighting.
